  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "35733854",
      "title": "Showing Error Pages with errorElement",
      "sourceHash": "f95da1fa42171d4378d23707baabceed2e8179e837d6e76c16727cf726e8d9d3",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.19,
          "end": 4.68,
          "en": "Now, you might remember that earlier,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.68,
          "end": 9.15,
          "en": "when we visited a route like our domain slash abc,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 9.15,
          "end": 12.78,
          "en": "we got this error page here, this default error message,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 12.78,
          "end": 16.473,
          "en": "which is actually generated by the react-router-dom package.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 17.55,
          "end": 19.35,
          "en": "Now of course, it's not unlikely,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 19.35,
          "end": 22.5,
          "en": "that over time visitors might accidentally,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 22.5,
          "end": 26.19,
          "en": "or, due to erroneous links provided by us,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 26.19,
          "end": 28.8,
          "en": "visit pages that they shouldn't visit,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 28.8,
          "end": 31.14,
          "en": "that simply don't exist.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 31.14,
          "end": 33.48,
          "en": "And therefore, you might want to prepare",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 33.48,
          "end": 37.113,
          "en": "a default error page that's shown in situations like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 38.1,
          "end": 40.83,
          "en": "To do that we could add a new page here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 40.83,
          "end": 44.853,
          "en": "called error page, like that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 48.15,
          "end": 52.65,
          "en": "and in here we could return our error page content.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 52.65,
          "end": 54.33,
          "en": "We could, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 54.33,
          "end": 57.003,
          "en": "include the main navigation here if you want to,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 57.93,
          "end": 60.24,
          "en": "and then below that have our main content",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 60.24,
          "end": 65.24,
          "en": "where we say an error occurred, could not find this page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 67.32,
          "end": 68.77,
          "en": "That's something we could do.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 70.32,
          "end": 73.41,
          "en": "Now to ensure that we also have the appropriate styling",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 73.41,
          "end": 77.43,
          "en": "for this main element, we could grab this definition",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 77.43,
          "end": 79.59,
          "en": "from the root.module file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 79.59,
          "end": 84.39,
          "en": "and actually copy that into index css, add it down there,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 84.39,
          "end": 87.273,
          "en": "and apply that to all main elements we find,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 88.32,
          "end": 90.78,
          "en": "and remove the root module css file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 90.78,
          "end": 93.84,
          "en": "remove this import and remove this class name,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 93.84,
          "end": 95.46000000000001,
          "en": "so that we now have the same styling,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 95.46000000000001,
          "end": 97.35,
          "en": "not just for our default layout,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 97.35,
          "end": 100.14,
          "en": "which is used if things go right,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 100.14,
          "end": 102.33,
          "en": "but also on this error page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 102.33,
          "end": 105,
          "en": "which is used when things go wrong.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 105,
          "end": 106.32,
          "en": "But how do we ensure,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 106.32,
          "end": 109.47,
          "en": "that this page is used when things go wrong?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 109.47,
          "end": 114.45,
          "en": "Well, actually the react-router-dom package tells us here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 114.45,
          "end": 117.45,
          "en": "we can add the special error element property,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 117.45,
          "end": 119.25,
          "en": "to our route definitions,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 119.25,
          "end": 121.98,
          "en": "to define which page should be loaded",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 121.98,
          "end": 124.713,
          "en": "if an error is created.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 125.79,
          "end": 129,
          "en": "For that, we can go to our route definitions and we could,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 129,
          "end": 131.28,
          "en": "for example, go to the products route here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 131.28,
          "end": 133.38,
          "en": "and add the error element prop,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 133.38,
          "end": 136.2,
          "en": "to define the element, that should be loaded",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 136.2,
          "end": 139.35,
          "en": "when this page throughs an error.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 139.35,
          "end": 141.48,
          "en": "Now we'll see situations",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 141.48,
          "end": 146.16,
          "en": "where this page could throw an error later in this section,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 146.16,
          "end": 149.88,
          "en": "but at the moment, this page actually can't throw an error,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 149.88,
          "end": 152.76,
          "en": "but there's root path could throw an error,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 152.76,
          "end": 157.62,
          "en": "because actually when we enter a URL that doesn't exist,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 157.62,
          "end": 161.43,
          "en": "the react-router-dom package will generate an error,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 161.43,
          "end": 165.42000000000002,
          "en": "and that error will automatically bubble up",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 165.42000000000002,
          "end": 167.57999999999998,
          "en": "to our root route definition.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 167.57999999999998,
          "end": 171.633,
          "en": "So to the route that is defined for path slash nothing.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 172.5,
          "end": 176.28,
          "en": "Therefore, here on this special slash nothing route,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 176.28,
          "end": 179.43,
          "en": "we can add the error element property as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 179.43,
          "end": 183,
          "en": "And then say that for this page, for this route,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 183,
          "end": 186.81,
          "en": "we wanna render the error page as a fallback page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 186.81,
          "end": 189.33,
          "en": "if an error occurs,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 189.33,
          "end": 192.15,
          "en": "and as I just mentioned an error will occur,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 192.15,
          "end": 195.03,
          "en": "because an error will be generated automatically",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 195.03,
          "end": 199.17000000000002,
          "en": "by the react-router-dom package if we try to visit a page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 199.17000000000002,
          "end": 200.28300000000002,
          "en": "that doesn't exist.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 201.24,
          "end": 205.05,
          "en": "So therefore, with the error page being imported",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 205.05,
          "end": 208.71,
          "en": "and being defined as an element here, if we save this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 208.71,
          "end": 211.41,
          "en": "you see that now if I visit slash abc,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 211.41,
          "end": 216.41,
          "en": "or any other unsupported route, we get this error page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 216.66,
          "end": 220.23,
          "en": "And that of course is a nicer user experience than showing",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 220.23,
          "end": 224.4,
          "en": "this default error message that's generated by the package.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 224.4,
          "end": 226.71,
          "en": "And that's there for how we can also support",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 226.71,
          "end": 230.49,
          "en": "situations like this, where users accidentally,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 230.49,
          "end": 232.07999999999998,
          "en": "or for whatever reason,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 232.07999999999998,
          "end": 235.893,
          "en": "visit URL's that don't exist and aren't supported.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}